## Model card

- **Name:** Muse Wonder Full
- **Short description:** Meta's flagship frontier model with advanced reasoning, coding, and agentic capabilities
- **Provider / access:** Meta via Muse Code subscription (Power Usage and Maximum Usage plans)
- **Release / knowledge:** Released October 12, 2026; knowledge cutoff not publicly documented
- **IDs:** `meta/muse-wonder-full`
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 tokens
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video, audio input; text output
- **Pricing (as of 2026):** Subscription-only through Muse Code ($50-$200/month), not available via pay-as-you-go API
- **Architecture:** Not publicly disclosed (proprietary)

